# Scratch git worktrees. Ignored via .git/info/exclude, which prettier does not
# read — so without this, `pnpm check` fails or passes depending on whether a
# worktree happens to exist right now, and the file it complains about is a
# second copy of the generated openapi.json ignored two lines above. A gate
# whose result depends on what else is on the disk is not a gate.
.claude/worktrees/
